In article <1521@spam.ua.oz> David Cook, dcook@spam.ua.oz writes:
>  I'm playing a lawful character in a game of nethack at the
>moment, and there is a neutral altar on the current level.
>My question : how do I convert the _altar_ to lawful ?

You should be in good standing with your diety and have good
luck. In other words, for a lawful character, did you attack any
peaceful beasts, shopkeepers, eat your dog, etc. Find and kill a
reasonably bad nasty (i.e. don't bother with kobolds, lizards, etc).
Stand on the altar, and #offer it. This is not a guaranteed
action. You will see a message "You sense a conflict between
<your god> and <other god>. You feel the power of <your god>
<increase/decrease>. (if successful) The newly consecrated
altar glows <black/gray/white>.

